    periodPullbackMap P Q f (P.quotientMap x) = Q.quotientMap (periodPullbackVectorMap f x) := by
  change
    (f x.1, standardLattice.mkQ ((P.periodEquiv x.1).symm x.2)) =
      (f x.1, standardLattice.mkQ ((Q.periodEquiv (f x.1)).symm x.2))
